{"id": "EUVD-2026-40964", "enisaUuid": "ebe7b6a8-f1ba-3f06-9aed-6969752bca5c", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amd/display: Fix out-of-bounds read in dp_get_eq_aux_rd_interval()\n\n[Why & How]\nThe aux_rd_interval array in struct dc_lttpr_caps is declared with\nMAX_REPEATER_CNT - 1 (7) elements, indexed 0..6. However, the offset\nparameter passed to dp_get_eq_aux_rd_interval() can be as large as\nMAX_REPEATER_CNT (8) when a sink reports 8 LTTPR repeaters via DPCD.\nThis leads to an out-of-bounds read of aux_rd_interval[7] when offset\nis 8.\n\nFix this by growing aux_rd_interval to MAX_REPEATER_CNT elements to\naccommodate the full range of valid repeater counts defined by the DP\nspec.\n\n(cherry picked from commit a55a458a8df37a65ffda5cf721d554a8f74f6b04)", "datePublished": "2026-07-01T13:32:15", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:42:32", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a632474c793b7f2a9bbd3d8e3d0dd7d256989300", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7c5f2d16a8f4464bf2a719ceb2316b8a6b87a3c0", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/454d3b3d499c18373f8960d31aea48338a3ca9e0", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dc1490927d79fe9621e29f4a4f5d7b5ccb6aea3e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e8b4d37eba05141ee01794fc6b7f2da808cee83b"], "aliases": ["GHSA-x86r-325j-5wq6", "CVE-2026-53330"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0a2b49cf-431c-327f-924e-d1faa7ee3fb9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.0.13"}, {"id": "0aae63bd-0037-354a-b16f-0cc581fa82be", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.36"}, {"id": "230530dd-d89a-34b2-b5ca-41bb59b3c6d7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5.6"}, {"id": "424e62d6-1d69-3f10-a4f5-f5dd3821c3d1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8e5100a575433cc185a2e224280fbd873b6692dd <7c5f2d16a8f4464bf2a719ceb2316b8a6b87a3c0"}, {"id": "45868622-527d-3e14-a784-e4b2fa9918dc", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.114"}, {"id": "5778b8c5-d50f-3218-a650-8db0320cfab8", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "78cba73d-d7f4-3746-9ade-8623e4c4a661", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.160"}, {"id": "a440431f-77d5-3943-a909-cab868c148f1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8e5100a575433cc185a2e224280fbd873b6692dd <dc1490927d79fe9621e29f4a4f5d7b5ccb6aea3e"}, {"id": "bc77285f-4e6f-3ac8-b0be-f29721561174", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8e5100a575433cc185a2e224280fbd873b6692dd <e8b4d37eba05141ee01794fc6b7f2da808cee83b"}, {"id": "d9db1de4-129b-3e4d-b2f4-5e0873e986df", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8e5100a575433cc185a2e224280fbd873b6692dd <454d3b3d499c18373f8960d31aea48338a3ca9e0"}, {"id": "da4b3361-1565-3857-b48d-9780e8783d02", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8e5100a575433cc185a2e224280fbd873b6692dd <a632474c793b7f2a9bbd3d8e3d0dd7d256989300"}, {"id": "eea874b4-1476-343e-a6a0-a838c79ad9df", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c211e477-4b1d-3761-8ca9-74e47f4ab6b8", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}